## Three gates this context adds
Beyond the studio's design-review + usability gates: **parity** (code matches Figma, zero drift, verified
in Storybook), **{{VERIFY_GATE}}** ({{VERIFY_GATE_DESC}}), **release** (verify-by-artifact + honest
declarations + confirmed by re-reading {{RELEASE_CONFIRM}}).

## Maintenance
On any component change: update its story + the shared-component-library skill, then commit + push. On a
{{SYSTEM_NAME}} republish: re-sync coded tokens, re-check parity, re-publish `{{COMPONENT_LIB}}`, tell the
prototype + app to bump. On a release: record version + commit + where it landed in the release runbook.

